In this situation, first we will follow SOP to do checklist;
Then we will call ATC, report our situation and request radar vectors;
If necessary, we will try to land as soon as possible.

If the air conditioning system fails during takeoff, we will return to land.
Because if the air conditioning system fails, the temperature will be too high or too low;
And the pressurization system may be out of work, it may affect flight safety.
